/div><h3 class=\"rt-Heading rt-r-size-4\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:700;font-size:19.8px;text-decoration:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;text-transform:none;min-height:0px;font-family:Inter, 'Inter Fallback';font-style:normal;line-height:26.4px;letter-spacing:-0.0495px;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;\">• Other information:</h3><div class=\"rt-Box rt-r-pb-3\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 13.2px;font-weight:400;font-size:17.6px;text-decoration:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;text-transform:none;min-height:0px;font-family:Inter, 'Inter Fallback';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;\"><span class=\"rt-Text rt-r-size-3\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-size:17.6px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border:0px;text-transform:none;min-height:0px;line-height:26.4px;letter-spacing:normal;white-space:pre-line;\">• We review applications to ensure a good fit and quality traffic<br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-size:inherit;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border:0px;text-transform:none;min-height:0px;\">• Please avoid coupon-only promotion unless explicitly approved<br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-size:inherit;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border:0px;text-transform:none;min-height:0px;\">• Always disclose affiliate partnerships (e.g., “This post contains affiliate links”)</span></div></div></div>",
